            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Source: US DOT / Bureau of Transportation Statistics | January 2025.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Severity bands include all eligible arrivals: completed, non-diverted flights with recorded arrival delay.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Median and P90 include only eligible arrivals delayed ≥15 minutes. P90 means 90% of those delays were at or below this duration.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Reported causes show attributed delay minutes among eligible delayed arrivals. A flight can contribute minutes to multiple categories.</run>
